{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52044","headline":"病後醮宅 · 王绩","name":"病後醮宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公干苦沉绵，居山畏不延。\n白驴迎蒯子，青牛下葛仙。\n度符南竈曲，写咒北阶前。\n龙行初禁火，鸟步即凌烟。\n净席三天坐，香鑪五帝筵。\n埋沙禳疫气，镇石御凶年。\n鬼用泥爲壁，神将纸作钱。\n山精愁镜厌，野魅怯灯然。\n今日扬雄宅，应堪草《太玄》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}